# Credits

Fulfillment-loop patterns informed by:

- **global-storage** by charlesbl — <https://github.com/charlesbl/global-storage>
- **item-network-sa-continued** by restjack — <https://github.com/restjack/item-network-sa-continued>

Both mods target Factorio 2.1 and run in production; their request-reading,
quality-aware counting, cursor-guard, and safe transfer-then-remove patterns
informed this mod's implementation. Their bugs (notably a bare `return` inside
the per-player loop aborting all remaining players) were deliberately not
copied.
